	quests: [
		{
			x: 5.5d
			y: -5.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Level Up!"
			description: [
				"&dDang, it's been quite a while since we've looked into the FOP Game Servers..."
				""
				"&5Looks like they piled on even more things to keep you working..."
				""
				"&dOkay, looks like two major systems control most things. Advent of Ascension, the FOP Game Server main system, and then Project MMO, which looks like they added more recently."
				""
				"&5We'll try to explain everything as we work it out ourselves, Bandit. A lot of the deeper systems are locked up between the two."
				""
				"&dWe'll change what we can to make it easier, but every time we do something overtly, the security system steps in and stops future attempts."
				""
				"&5We'll have to figure out a workaround. For now though, let's examine some of this stuff..."
			]
			dependencies: ["110C1EFD863C907C"]
			hide: true
			id: "0CAB7196EB0D5F4C"
			tasks: [{
				id: "580C165D037049F8"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "So Many Levels"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 0.5d
			y: -5.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "MOD: Advent of Ascension"
			description: [
				"&5So this is the big one you'll have to deal with. The entire FOP Game Server is built around the Advent of Ascension game."
				""
				"&dIt adds and changes so many things to a 'vanilla' game of Minecraft that the Game is based on."
				""
				"&5The Game Server is so expansive, it may as well BE the entirety of the FOP corporation at this point. They do all their manufacturing through it, base their advertising from it..."
				""
				"&dHell, even some of their CEOs and board of directors live IN the game."
				""
				"&5Right. For now, if you hit Delete on your keyboard, you'll open up the AoA menu, which we can explain parts of now."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["0CAB7196EB0D5F4C"]
			hide: true
			id: "6DEFECFABD4DCB59"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3415946BA5D0FB05"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "The Main System"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 9.0d
			y: -5.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "MOD: Project MMO"
			description: [
				"&5Huh, they added another layer of skills and abilities to the system a few months ago."
				""
				"&dInteresting... but a weird choice. They already had an MMO style system in with their Advent of Ascension core. Why add ano...wait, what am I saying. More game layers, more carrots on a stick."
				""
				"&5Hm, too many and it confuses players. Gets them to stop playing. But FOP, I guess, thinks that since you all are prisoners, there isn't really a 'stop' as a valid option."
				""
				"&dLooks like you can level things and get extra abilities. Just do your thing: mining, building, crafting."
				""
				"&5Shift + P on your keyboard will open up the Project MMO interface."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["6DEFECFABD4DCB59"]
			hide: true
			id: "45D2E30FD73E062E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "00366192B3CEDE4B"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "The Second Layer"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Every Aspect, Gamefied"
			description: [
				"&5Wow... I think they removed some skills since we last looked into this..."
				""
				"&dBut there's still a lot. Daunting, isn't it... But don't worry, thankfully the FOP built in a guide to all these skills in their AoA menu."
				""
				"&5Each skill earns experience by doing specific things. Most of them are pretty obvious. Farming is gained by... farming, for example. Hauling is Fishing. Etc."
				""
				"&dEtc etc etc. You get the idea. Some things are gonna be locked behind leveling some of these. And leveling them will get you better 'rewards' for doing them."
				""
				"&5You can click on a skill name to get a better idea of them."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["6DEFECFABD4DCB59"]
			hide: true
			id: "78B5BCD7C6C45779"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4080321A77B04EDC"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Advent of Skills"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -0.9285714285714306d
			y: 0.017857142857145902d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "So many meters..."
			description: [
				"&5AoA adds a few resource meters to keep in mind. They encourage you to keep doing things and keep working to keep them filled."
				""
				"&dAs you level your AoA skills, the meters get easier to fill and give bigger bonuses."
				""
				"&5First is Battle Rage. Fighting raises your Battle Rage meter maximum, which slowly regenerates. The higher you get, the higher chance of an extra critical hit, which will empty the meter."
				""
				"&dHuh, I see they got rid of Creation. It let you summon pets. I wonder why..."
				""
				"&5Some tools, blocks, and weapons use Spirit for power and ammunition."
				""
				"&dSoul Power is used to activate Tablets, craftable utility items."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["6DEFECFABD4DCB59"]
			hide: true
			id: "19220F4E56CB0A0F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "426BA08035022DCC"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Advent of Resources"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -2.0d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Prayer and Sacrifice"
			description: [
				"&5These are the Tribute bars. At some point, we aren't sure whether the FOP created fake 'Gods' for the Game Server, or if a prisoner 'ascended' by exploiting the game in some way, and became part of the system itself."
				""
				"&dEach one covers a different game God. Each bar raises or lowers depending on actions."
				""
				"&5It seems the bars reset when night is finished. So you have the whole day to fill them as much as you can. If you do, each one can give you a different reward as night falls."
				""
				"&dHmm, looking into it, if you get all four above a certain level, you get a bonus from a fifth God? And filling all four to max nets you a tool to gain Tribute quickly."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["6DEFECFABD4DCB59"]
			hide: true
			id: "33C206FEA6772466"
			tasks: [{
				id: "31F63991B3631A9D"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Advent of Gods"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 7.75d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Improving Yourself"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, looks like the main buttons you need to worry about are these two here. Stats and Skills."
				""
				"&5Stats show what bonuses you get with your skills. Looks like with enough skill, you can chop down bigger amounts of logs or larger sections of ore veins."
				""
				"&dAnd you have a bigger chance at better loot, or avoiding fall damage. Hm...if these buffs stack with their Advent buffs, and the other systems their Game Server has in place...."
				""
				"&5I wonder if they tested it enough before adding it. And just how protected their safeguards are..."
				""
				"&dI smell a system vulnerability."
				""
				"&5Let's add it to the list. It's going to take careful planning to break the system. Every exploit is another opening."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["45D2E30FD73E062E"]
			hide: true
			id: "40E4E5113E933B44"
			tasks: [{
				id: "483B8AF014C584F7"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "MMO Stats and Skills"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: 10.5d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "What Does What?"
			description: [
				"&5Oh, here we go, this glossary lists what gives you experience, and what bonsues you get when."
				""
				"&dOh, apparently most equipment is level locked? No no no, that will NOT do..."
				""
				"&5Sis, be careful..."
				""
				"&dIt'll lock down the item level requirement, but that just means I gotta hit it with a big change all at the same time."
				""
				"&2ITEM DATABASE UPDATED."
				""
				"&2LEVEL RESTRICTION CONFIGURATION UPDATED"
				""
				"&4SECURITY SYSTEM UPDATED FOR USER PROTECTION."
				""
				"&dI couldn't remove the restriction, so I lowered everything I could. The more powerful items have tougher security layers, so I didn't have time to fix them. Sorry."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["45D2E30FD73E062E"]
