		{
			x: -4.5d
			y: -2.0d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Things to Fight, Things to Do"
			description: [
				"&5Well, at least they include a pretty helpful guide on their game system."
				""
				"&dRight? It's decently extensive, and it should be enough to get started with, and point you to helpful things. I'll give them that much."
				""
				"&5We'll look over this as well and figure out a game plan. "
				""
				"&dAgreed. Layering so many systems on each other has probably opened up a vulnerability..."
			]
