				item: "hardcorequesting:quest_book"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Salvage Operations"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "Repurpose Old Things"
			description: [
				"&dWell, looks like one of the systems of the Project MMO layer is 'Salvaging'. It lets you break down some items to get one of their components."
				""
				"&5Oh, no Uncrafting Table I take it?"
				""
				"&dUnfotunately not, bro. That'd be nice, but they've entwined Salvaging with their leveling systems. "
				""
				"&5Ah, they tied it to Smithing. Strange choice. Looks like you'll need a Smithing Table to Salvage items."
				""
				"&dWhich you level by smelting Ores in a normal Furnace. I'm unsure if things like the Smeltery will work, though. But Salvaging items also levels Smithing."
				""
				"&5Hmm, the ProjectMMO screen lists Salvagable items, and the level of Smithing you need. But it doesn't say how to Salvage..."
				""
				"&dOh hey, Bitsy just figured it out! You Shift + Right Click the item onto the Smithing Table to try Salvaging it!"
			]
			dependencies: ["14E05D152CF5C051"]
			id: "2BBEFF6E9B2C2E8A"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7A994D653FB87F7F"
