		{
			title: "Forged in Magma"
			x: 0.25d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "That Which Does Not Burn"
			description: [
				"&dInteresting! That's a new thing for the Advent of Ascension game layer..."
				""
				"&5What's up, sis?"
				""
				"&dLotsa these worlds have deadly Lava..."
				""
				"&5Yeah, everybody has died at least once to Lava."
				""
				"&dYeah, and if those players quit the game, or for Power Users, have their Soul harvested, then their graves 'dissolve' and release their items into the Lava."
				""
				"&5Wait, they don't burn?"
				""
				"&dNo, but they aren't put back into the database either. So, the FOP created the Extraction Device. Place it with open air below it, pour a bucket of Lava on top. The machine will pull it in, so then Right Click a Stone Bowl onto it. It sifts through the Lava for items, turning it into Obsidian underneath. Clear the Obsidian to Extract again."
			]
			dependencies: ["14E05D152CF5C051"]
			id: "13443B45E662A04C"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1D50D6BECE193C9B"
