		}
		{
			title: "Creating Life"
			x: 5.5d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "Creating Friends!"
			description: [
				"&dOne of the many systems that the AoA layer adds is the Creation system."
				""
				"&5It used to be used for summoning pets to help you. Thus, creation. That recently got removed, however..."
				""
				"&dIt was an interesting system, but hard to balance I guess, brother. But yeah, to get started in it, you need to make a Stone Bowl, and find yourself a Pixon."
				""
				"&5Pixons are...strange things. They look like tiny starbursts constantly exploding."
				""
				"&dOr like an animated * symbol. You can't kill them with normal weapons. But Right Clicking a Stone or Diamond Bowl on them will damage them and give you an Infusion Stone."
				""
				"&5A lot of the FOPServer worlds have unique Pixons. The Overworld has the Glistening one, getting you a Glistening Infusion Stone."
			]
			dependencies: ["14E05D152CF5C051"]
			id: "1F2875BC889232AC"
