		}
		{
			title: "Life and Infusion"
			x: 5.5d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "An Infusion of Power"
			description: [
				"&dNow that you have an Infusion Stone or three, you can make the first steps in the Infusion system. Starting off, you'll need an Infusion Table."
				""
				"&5Then you'll need a Blank Slab. Which will take Runium, and thats locked under... looks like Yellow Ore DLC? Huh they moved it up from Orange..."
				""
				"&dStrange. I wonder why... Well, once you get that Runium, you can make a Blank Slab. Originally, you would imprint a creature to summon, but they patched that out recently. "
				""
				"&5That's super strange. I wonder if the new ProjectMMO layer was causing issues with it?"
				""
				"&dNo clue. Wonder what the Creation Forge will be used for, now?"
			]
			dependencies: ["1F2875BC889232AC"]
