		}
		{
			title: "Crystalized Skill"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "A Little Boost"
			description: [
				"&dIf you get your Advent of Ascension Foraging skill (which is different than the Project MMO's Mining skill, but... the same... thing...)"
				""
				"&5Don't mind sis, trying to make logical thoughts about the FOP's server decisions hurts my head too..."
				""
				"&dEr, right. Well, these things are Skill Crystals. They come in varying sizes, but the smallest one can be found either in loot chests around the world, or as a bonus drop when your Foraging skill is high enough and you mine Stone."
				""
				"&5You hold them and Right Click them against the ground. They'll raise up the lowest Advent of Ascension skill you have with a bit of XP."
				""
				"&dBut only skills that are at least level 15 will count. They didn't want Users to power level their friends easily."
			]
			dependencies: ["14E05D152CF5C051"]
			id: "2E8B1B1D23FEAF8E"
			tasks: [{
				id: "03EE998A065A93D5"
