		{
			title: "Hauling in the Big Catches"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&5One of the majorly overlooked skills in Advent of Ascension is Hauling."
				""
				"&dThat's hauling as in, fish hauling. Fishing really. It's often overlooked as it's not 'lucrative', but if there's one thing the FOP did right, its that Fishing in the FOP Game Server is actually beneficial."
				""
				"&5It just takes a while to level up. Especially at the start, as you have to get to Hauling 15 to be able to use the special Hauling Rod."
				""
				"&dThe Hauling Rod, and other AoA rods like it, can pull from a special 'selection' of items depending on where you fish, and at what level."
				""
				"&5Also Note...when you start using the Hauling Rod, you have a chance of pulling up creatures themselves. Some of them may fight you. So have a weapon handy as well."
				""
				"&dWatch, catch a Violet Skipper..."
			]
			dependencies: ["14E05D152CF5C051"]
