		{
			title: "Caged Fish"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&dWhen you reach 31 in Hauling, you can use Fish Cages."
				""
				"&5It's amusing when you try to use one without having the skill. It just...pops out of your hands. Usually into your inventory."
				""
				"&dOr onto the ground if your inventory is full. But yeah, leveling up your Hauling, and you'll get to use Fishing Cages. "
				""
				"&5You can use these in water to place them, and they'll passively catch certain fish. Or other things."
				""
				"&dThey can only hold a couple stacks of fish or goodies, so you'll want to Right Click them to empty them regularly."
				""
				"&5Right Clicking is important. If you Left Click, you destroy the trap. You get the goodies, but no Hauling XP."
			]
			dependencies: ["4342B9F453AD1F1B"]
