			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&5When you hit 54 Hauling, you'll be able to go fishing in new waters. "
				""
				"&dYou mean Lava. "
				""
				"&5Okay so its not water. But you'll be able to use a Thermally Insulated Rod to get special fish in any pool of Lava."
				""
				"&dAlso it's good to note many of the AoA Dimensions have their own...special fish you can catch."
				""
				"&5Sometimes bigger than fish..."
