		{
			title: "To Heavenly Waters"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "square"
			description: [
				"&5Once you hit Hauling 69..."
				""
				"&dN&5i&dc&5e."
				""
				"&5You can use the Light Rod. It's much better at pulling in good stuff."
				""
				"&dAnd once you hit 100 Hauling, you can don the Helm of the Trawler."
				""
				"&5This will boost the Hauling XP gain. And from there, if you get all the way up to 1000 Hauling."
				""
				"&dYour Helm of the Trawler gets a special look to it."
				""
				"&5Also, that Trawler hat is unbreakable. Cool, eh? Though it's a bit difficult to get..."
				""
				"&dThe FOP only have it available in their Shop, unfortunately."
