		{
			title: "Infusing Power"
			x: 6.5d
			y: 3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dThe Infusion Table is used for more than just making Armor and Weapons. You can use the Infusion Table to enchant as well."
				""
				"&5You'll need two things: Enhancers, and Power Stones. Those are more powerful versions of the Infusion Stones you've been collecting from Pixons."
				""
				"&dYou'll have a small chance of getting a Power Stone if you use a Diamond Bowl on Pixons instead of a Stone one."
				""
				"&5As for Enhancers, theres a little less than a dozen you can make. You'll need them in certain combinations. Good luck figuring those out, the FOP didn't document it in game very well unfortunately..."
			]
