		{
			title: "Curios and Baubles"
			icon: "curios:ring"
			x: -4.25d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Curios"
			description: [
				"&dThe FOPGame Server adds a whole lot of equipment slots in the form of Curios."
				""
				"&5These used to be called Baubles in previous versions of the game. But they are things like Rings, Amulets, and other accessories you can wear. Like the Ferret Wallet, to hold your Silver Ferret Coins, can go into a slot that's marked as \"Wallet\"."
				""
				"&dTo access your Curios equipment, open up your inventory. In the upper left of your character image, you will see a little * looking symbol. Thats your Curios equipment page."
			]
