		{
			title: "Returning to Safety"
			icon: "waystones:return_scroll"
			x: -5.5d
			y: 2.25d
			shape: "square"
			subtitle: "MOD : Waystones (teleporting)"
			description: [
				"&dSometimes, you just get stuck somewhere you don't want to be in the FOPGame Server."
				""
				"&5Or you just want a quick way back home, but don't got the tools or materials for teleporting on you."
				""
				"&dInstead of a standard /home or /spawn or whatever command most games have with a cooldown, the FOPGame Server has Waystones teleporting."
				""
				"&5You've probably noticed in your inventory, to the lower right of your character, is a scroll. You can click this to teleport back to the last Waystone you touched."
				""
				"&dThe only cavaet is you have to have touched a Waystone in that dimension in the firstplace. "
			]
